  + ## [0.1.9] — 2026-04-29
    
  - 12 commits spanning Days 50–52. Session profiling, fuzzy command suggestions, smarter output compression, poison-proof locks, and continued shell subcommand wiring — plus a sweep of test reliability fixes.
